The League recruits among Social Democratic and non-party workers; two thirds of its members, in time, carry no party card. The marches are large, noisy, and a matter of local pride in the working-class districts.

@army
subtitle: Units +50, militancy up, Left +3 strength.
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.04; y23_hundreds += 1; kf_left_strength += 3; workers_spd -= 1
go-to: root

The League drills with a military bearing. It is smaller than it could have been and harder than the police like. The state remembers what the Hundreds were meant for.
